
========================================================================
1. initialize - handshake
========================================================================
server      : cua-capabilities v1.0.0
protocol    : 2024-11-05
capabilities: tools, resources

instructions to the agent:
  Each tool is a recorded, human-approved automation of a legacy banking workflow, replayed deterministically with no model in the loop. Results distinguish success from expected business outcomes (e.g. account closed) — treat a business outcome as an answer, not an error. A pending escalation means a human operator was asked to intervene; the run is parked, not failed.

========================================================================
2. tools/list - what can this agent invoke?
========================================================================

  firstcore_fee_waiver__firstcore_desktop(account_id: string)
      Waive an assessed overdraft fee (thick client). Surface: desktop (firstcore-desktop). Returns: outcome (waived | not_permitted | not_found), confirmation_number, fee_ref. Recorded from: "In Fee Management, look up the account and waive the assessed overdraft fee, reaching the reversal confirmation.". Artifact v1, approved.

  firstcore_fee_waiver__firstcore_legacy(account_id: string)
      FirstCore — Waive Assessed Overdraft Fee. Surface: legacyweb (firstcore-legacy). Returns: outcome (waived | not_found | account_closed), confirmation_message, confirmation_number, fee_ref, waived_amount. Recorded from: "In Fee Management, look up the account and waive the assessed overdraft fee, reaching the reversal confirmation. Record the capability so an agent can waive a fee on any account. Test accounts you may probe to ground outcome conditions: 12345 healthy (use for the recorded flow), 55555 transient host congestion on first attempts, 99999 closed account (writes rejected), 77777 no records, 00000 restricted party whose waive triggers a blocking security modal - probe it last.". Artifact v2, approved.

  firstcore_fee_waiver__firstcore_modern(account_id: string)
      Waive an assessed overdraft fee (modern portal). Surface: web (firstcore-modern). Returns: outcome (waived | not_permitted | not_found), confirmation_number, account_name. Recorded from: "Look up the account in Fee management and waive the assessed fee, reaching the reversal confirmation.". Artifact v1, approved.

